  "explanation": "I summed on-hand base units (tablets) for SKU 100059 at NW001 in marts.fct_inventory_batch: 630 from batch B0023468 and 30 from batch B0020149. None of it is expired, and NW001 has no in-transit transfers for this SKU, so nothing is reserved. The snapshot is 2026-09-15."
}
